 "source_selection": "Orden PEJ/1229/2024 (BOA no. 202, 16 October 2024) declares the 'Rhodes' data-centre campus in Calatorao, promoted by Calanza Inmuebles SL (controlled by Blackstone-managed funds, with QTS as delegated promoter and future manager), an investment of autonomous and general interest. Its area is sector SUI-4 of the Calatorao plan (224 ha), and annex I lists the reparcelling plots of SUI-4 with their long cadastral references, followed by adjoining non-developable parcels. The annex tables are images; their 57 cadastral references were read by OCR, and each returned exactly one parcel from the Catastro INSPIRE WFS (GetParcel). The adjoining non-developable parcels and the exterior connections are excluded. Orden VFL/1400/2026 (BOA, 30 September 2026; partial final approval of the PIGA 'Proyecto Rhodes') confirms the area as sector SUI-4 'Campus Data Center', 223.4 ha.",
